==Battleground==
*1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns after 14 seconds<sup>420f</sup>.
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns after 14 seconds<sup>420f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss after 14 seconds<sup>420f</sup>.
*1 [[Zapy]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to the enemy limit of 3, the Bun Bun variants will only spawn once the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] are permanently dead, either from a [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]] or from being defeated twice in Zapy's case. Because of this, it is possible to [[cheese]] this stage and win without having to fight the Bun Bun variants. If you simply want to brute-force this stage, bring a plethora of [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating units]] and prioritize killing the Zapy first. Avoid using Z-Killers until Zapy has died for the second time, then spawn units as you usually would.

==Trivia==
*The "Love" in Don't Rush Love may be the same "love" mentioned in the descriptions of [[Teacher Bun Bun]] and [[Bun Bun Black]], being used as an euphemism for violence.

